Prohibiting foreign adversary property
HB0224
ownership.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Banks, Allemand, Andrew, Angelos,
Hoeft, Neiman, Riggins, Singh, Strock, Styvar,
Tarver, Webber and Winter and Senator(s) Boner,
Brennan, French, Hutchings, Laursen, D, McKeown,
Pearson and Steinmetz
AN ACT relating to property; restricting foreign adversary ownership of land
and other interests in Wyoming as specified; providing definitions; authorizing
enforcement of ownership restrictions as specified; providing a civil penalty;
requiring the inclusion of notices of foreign ownership in assessment schedules
and tax statements; specifying applicability; requiring rulemaking; and
providing for a contingent effective date.
